      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6179,
      "text": "except those who believe and do righteous deeds, and exhort one another to the truth and exhort one another to patience.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 103,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَصۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Asr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Declining Day, Epoch",
        "numberOfAyahs": 3,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 601,
      "ruku": 545,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6180,
      "text": "Woe to every backbiter and slanderer,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 104,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الهُمَزَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Humaza",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Traducer",
        "numberOfAyahs": 9,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 601,
      "ruku": 546,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6181,
      "text": "who amasses wealth and counts it over and again[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 104,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الهُمَزَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Humaza",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Traducer",
        "numberOfAyahs": 9,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 601,
      "ruku": 546,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6182,
      "text": "thinking that his wealth will make him live forever.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 104,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الهُمَزَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Humaza",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Traducer",
        "numberOfAyahs": 9,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 601,
      "ruku": 546,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6183,
      "text": "No indeed! He will surely be cast into the Crushing Fire[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 104,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الهُمَزَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Humaza",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Traducer",
        "numberOfAyahs": 9,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 601,
      "ruku": 546,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6184,
      "text": "and how do you know what the Crushing Fire is?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 104,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الهُمَزَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Humaza",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Traducer",
        "numberOfAyahs": 9,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 601,
      "ruku": 546,
      "hizbQuarter": 240,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6185,
      "text": "It is the kindled Fire of Allah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 104,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الهُمَزَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Humaza",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Traducer",
        "numberOfAyahs": 9,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
